### Home Assistant REST API — Quick Reference
### Usage: Open this file in VS Code, click "Send Request" above any request
### Requires: REST Client extension (humao.rest-client) + .env with HA_TOKEN

@baseUrl = http://192.168.0.111:8123
@token = {{$dotenv HA_TOKEN}}

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════
# System
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════

### Check API status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get HA config (version, location, units)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/config HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Validate configuration before restart
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/config/core/check_config HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Restart Home Assistant
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/services/homeassistant/restart HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════
# States & Entities
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════

### Get all entity states
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/states HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get single entity state (change entity_id as needed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/states/light.smart_multicolor_bulb HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get FP300 occupancy sensor
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/states/binary_sensor.presence_multi_sensor_fp300_occupancy HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get gateway WAN status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/states/binary_sensor.gateway_lite_wan_status HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════
# Lights
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════

### Turn on office bulb (warm white, full brightness)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/services/light/turn_on HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entity_id": "light.smart_multicolor_bulb",
  "brightness": 255,
  "color_temp_kelvin": 4000
}

### Turn off office bulb
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/services/light/turn_off HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entity_id": "light.smart_multicolor_bulb"
}

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════
# History
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════

### Get entity history (last 24h) — change entity_id and dates
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/history/period/2026-03-15T00:00:00Z?end_time=2026-03-16T00:00:00Z&filter_entity_id=binary_sensor.presence_multi_sensor_fp300_occupancy&no_attributes HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════
# Tesla
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════

### Get Tesla battery level
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/states/sensor.tesla_model_y_battery HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Tesla location
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/states/device_tracker.tesla_model_y_location_tracker HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Flash Tesla lights
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/services/button/press HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entity_id": "button.tesla_model_y_flash_lights"
}

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════
# Network
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════

### Get external IP
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/states/sensor.gateway_lite_external_ip HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get download speed
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/states/sensor.gateway_lite_download_speed HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Restart gateway (careful!)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/services/button/press HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entity_id": "button.gateway_lite_restart"
}

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════
# Automations
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════

### List all automations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/states?filter_entity_id=automation. HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create/update an automation (change ID in URL)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/config/automation/config/my_automation_id HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "alias": "My Automation",
  "description": "",
  "trigger": [],
  "condition": [],
  "action": [],
  "mode": "single"
}
